  "description": "CosmoReport.Core PDF/Image export bridge backed by CosmoPdf — zero native deps, supports PDF/A-3b, embedded XML attachments, Arabic shaping, Roslyn-based ScriptText. ImageExport / EscPos exports use CosmoFonts (pure-C# OpenType + GSUB/GPOS/BiDi) + CosmoImagePdf.Shared raster surface + CosmoImage decode — no SixLabors.ImageSharp. The netstandard2.0 target carries the PDF/CSV/HTML/Excel/Word path plus Image/ZPL export (pictures decoded by CosmoImagePdf.Shared's pure PNG/JPEG decoders); EscPos exports need net10.",
